+        physicalDensitySum (actualSmallRoughModuli (retainOdd epsilon N) N (cap N) w z)
+            (actualSmallRoughRho (retainOdd epsilon N) N (cap N) w z L) ≤
+          currentK * (singularSeries N / Real.log (N : ℝ))
